transcripts/2026/05/04/procore-pcor-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2025 Q2","e":"pcor","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Craig F. Courtemanche","x":"So though there's a lot of noise now around tariffs and other things.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/procore-pcor-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2025 Q2","e":"pcor","d":"2025-07-31","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Craig F. Courtemanche","x":"Our customers have built in a lot of flexibility into the way that they actually contract to help them around tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/procore-pcor-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2025 Q2","e":"pcor","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Craig F. Courtemanche","x":"Procore won the deal by demonstrating our ability to streamline their financial processes, enhance budget management and deliver a fully integrated solution that could support the unique needs for all business units.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/procore-pcor-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2025 Q2","e":"pcor","d":"2025-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Craig F. Courtemanche","x":"With Procore's crucial field office connection, they can now operate with greater efficiency from the office, streamlining communication task management and accountability to complete their builds on time and on budget.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/procore-pcor-q2-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2025 Q4","e":"pcor","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"A primary example of the growing demand for these solutions is in data centers, where AI infrastructure is driving unprecedented investments.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/procore-pcor-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2025 Q4","e":"pcor","d":"2026-02-12","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"And that's why we've built a scalable, enterprise-grade infrastructure to ensure that every AI action is secure, compliant and contextually relevant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/procore-pcor-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q1","e":"pcor","d":"2026-05-05","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"We launched a new BIN model federation and streaming viewer, which enable customers to federate and navigate large 3D building information models directly within Procore.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/procore-pcor-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q1","e":"pcor","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"Our flagship products and early investments in AI, including our acquisition of Datagrid, has positioned us well to capitalize on the disruptive technology.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/procore-pcor-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q1","e":"pcor","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"By leveraging Procore AI, Crest has done a manual process that could spend weeks of effort down to an automation that can take as little as 20 minutes.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/procore-pcor-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q1","e":"pcor","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"The primary goal of this expansion was to achieve increased labor productivity, mitigate risk and streamline project management operations in a single location.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/procore-pcor-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q1","e":"pcor","d":"2026-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"And frankly, I guess the other point is that the intent behind the packaging was to really streamline the sales cycle.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/procore-pcor-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q1","e":"pcor","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Ajei Gopal","x":"I remain optimistic for Procore's future, which is reflected in our financial performance for Q1, where we exceeded the high end of guidance and increased our full year outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/procore-pcor-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q3","e":"pcor","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rachel Pyles","x":"We are investing in AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/procore-pcor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q3","e":"pcor","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Analyst","x":"So what is the sensitivity of gross margin to AI compute at scale?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/procore-pcor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q3","e":"pcor","d":"2026-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rachel Pyles","x":"So for the full year, we did raise the guidance by $45 million at the high end.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/procore-pcor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PCOR 2026 Q3","e":"pcor","d":"2026-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Ajei S. Gopal","x":"Given this momentum, we are raising full year guidance beyond our Q3 beat.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/04/procore-pcor-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[47,1,9733,0,0,0,7562,1675],[48,1,8480,0,0,0,6991,1174],[49,1,6773,0,0,0,5227,1185],[50,1,9564,0,0,0,7850,1142],[62,1,7348,0,0,0,5281,1484],[63,1,9072,0,0,0,7090,1564],[64,1,6893,0,0,0,5860,840],[65,1,7647,0,0,0,6184,1224],[67,1,9675,0,0,0,2512,6359]],"cinema":[[47,1,9733,0,0,0,7562,1675],[48,1,8480,0,0,0,6991,1174],[49,1,6773,0,0,0,5227